rs/Jisse-Meruma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hi @kradalby,\r\n\r\nThank you for your feedback. I understand your concern about applying this to all endpoints.\r\n\r\nI agree that not all endpoints require CORS headers. However, the Tailscale Client does use several non-API routes — specifically `/register`, `/key`, `/machine`,  `/derp`,  `/verify` and `/health` — to communicate with the Headscale server via HTTP requests. For these endpoints, implementing CORS headers is necessary to allow proper functionality when CORS is enabled. Additionally, the Tailscale SSH web client operates for example in a similar manner.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, I understand that certain endpoints such as  `/apple`, `/windows`, and `/swagger` do not need CORS headers.\r\n\r\nI will give you a code draft of our idea on how to implement this in a simple matter.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions feel free to ask me for any clarification if needed.\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-01-28T11:09:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T16:04:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1931974168","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1931974168"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1931974168"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1931974168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":515,"original_line":470,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1930645536,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":16,"position":61,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1931995439","pull_request_review_id":2577928290,"id":1931995439,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOEFLz885zJ-kv","diff_hunk":"@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@ grpc_listen_addr: 127.0.0.1:50443\n # are doing.\n grpc_allow_insecure: false\n \n+# The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header specifies which origins are allowed to access resources.\n+# Options:\n+# - \"*\" to allow access from any origin (not recommended for sensitive data).","path":"config-example.yaml","commit_id":"cbf6a43e0d4e893501457e080313831a3ec0dd59","original_commit_id":"dfad6a1756449700e08f4495294890f63e28f5f6","user":{"login":"Jisse-Meruma","id":95289996,"node_id":"U_kgDOBa4CjA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95289996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma","html_url":"https://github.com/Jisse-Meruma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hi @kradalby,\r\n\r\nThank you for your input. I completely understand the concern about providing a wildcard `*` and the importance of specifying domains explicitly.\r\n\r\nWe can certainly disable the use of `*` for domain whitelisting and enforce explicit domain declarations. Our initial idea was to implement an \"Allow list\" where users can specify any allowed domain. \r\n\r\nAs recommended by MDN: `If the server supports clients from multiple origins, it must return the origin for the specific client making the request.` Additionally, MDN advises adding the `Vary: Origin` header to inform clients that the response varies based on the `Origin` header.\r\n\r\nFurther information and recommendations can be found https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Access-Control-Allow-Origin.\r\n\r\n---\r\nI will show you a code draft to implement this feature soon. Feel free to give any feedback on the idea.","created_at":"2025-01-28T11:26:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T11:26:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1931995439","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1931995439"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1931995439"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1931995439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":45,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1930647409,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1932011751","pull_request_review_id":2577959947,"id":1932011751,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOEFLz885zKCjn","diff_hunk":"@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@ grpc_listen_addr: 127.0.0.1:50443\n # are doing.\n grpc_allow_insecure: false\n \n+# The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header specifies which origins are allowed to access resources.\n+# Options:\n+# - \"*\" to allow access from any origin (not recommended for sensitive data).\n+# - \"http://example.com\" to only allow access from a specific origin.\n+# - \"\" to disable Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS).\n+access_control_allow_origin: \"\"","path":"config-example.yaml","commit_id":"cbf6a43e0d4e893501457e080313831a3ec0dd59","original_commit_id":"dfad6a1756449700e08f4495294890f63e28f5f6","user":{"login":"Jisse-Meruma","id":95289996,"node_id":"U_kgDOBa4CjA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95289996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma","html_url":"https://github.com/Jisse-Meruma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jisse-Meruma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hi @kradalby,\r\n\r\nYes I suggest to have an structure like this:\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\napi:\r\n    cors_allow_origins: [] # as a list\r\n```\r\n     \r\nor\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\ncors:\r\n     allow_origins: [] # as a list\r\n```\r\n---\r\nI would value your input on which approach you prefer.\r\n","created_at":"2025-01-28T11:38:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T11:38:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1932011751","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1932011751"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2302#discussion_r1932011751"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2302"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments/1932011751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":48,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1930644890,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":9,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]